<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich January inflation rises to 0.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich January inflation rises to 0.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich, Switzerland's biggest city, rose 0.3 percent in January from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.9 percent, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997	Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   +0.3 pct	+0.1 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.9 pct	+0.8 pct	+1.4 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  103.3	   103.1	   102.4</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
